{"sentences":[{"id":"s_work_ttr_107_1","chapterId":"ch_work_ttr_107","textTraditional":"【經】","sentenceOrder":1},{"id":"s_work_ttr_107_2","chapterId":"ch_work_ttr_107","textTraditional":"十有一年春，楚子伐麇。","sentenceOrder":2},{"id":"s_work_ttr_107_3","chapterId":"ch_work_ttr_107","textTraditional":"夏，叔仲彭生會晉郤缺于承筐。","sentenceOrder":3},{"id":"s_work_ttr_107_4","chapterId":"ch_work_ttr_107","textTraditional":"秋，曹伯來朝。","sentenceOrder":4},{"id":"s_work_ttr_107_5","chapterId":"ch_work_ttr_107","textTraditional":"公子遂如宋。","sentenceOrder":5},{"id":"s_work_ttr_107_6","chapterId":"ch_work_ttr_107","textTraditional":"狄侵齊。","sentenceOrder":6},{"id":"s_work_ttr_107_7","chapterId":"ch_work_ttr_107","textTraditional":"冬十月甲午，叔孫得臣敗狄于鹹。","sentenceOrder":7},{"id":"s_work_ttr_107_8","chapterId":"ch_work_ttr_107","textTraditional":"【傳】","sentenceOrder":8},{"id":"s_work_ttr_107_9","chapterId":"ch_work_ttr_107","textTraditional":"十一年春，楚子伐麇，成大心服麇師於防渚。潘崇復伐麇，至于錫穴。","sentenceOrder":9},{"id":"s_work_ttr_107_10","chapterId":"ch_work_ttr_107","textTraditional":"夏，叔仲惠伯會晉郤缺于承筐，謀諸侯之從於楚者。","sentenceOrder":10},{"id":"s_work_ttr_107_11","chapterId":"ch_work_ttr_107","textTraditional":"秋，曹文公來朝，即位而來見也。","sentenceOrder":11},{"id":"s_work_ttr_107_12","chapterId":"ch_work_ttr_107","textTraditional":"襄仲聘于宋，且言司城蕩意諸而復之，因賀楚師之不害也。","sentenceOrder":12},{"id":"s_work_ttr_107_13","chapterId":"ch_work_ttr_107","textTraditional":"鄋瞞侵齊，遂伐我。公卜，使叔孫得臣追之，吉。侯叔夏御莊叔，緜房甥為右，富父終甥駟乘。冬十月甲午，敗狄于鹹，獲長狄僑如。富父終甥摏其喉以戈，殺之，埋其首於子駒之門，以命宣伯。","sentenceOrder":13},{"id":"s_work_ttr_107_14","chapterId":"ch_work_ttr_107","textTraditional":"初，宋武公之世，鄋瞞伐宋。司徒皇父帥師禦之，耏班御皇父充石，公子穀甥為右，司寇牛父駟乘，以敗狄于長丘，獲長狄緣斯，皇父之二子死焉。宋公於是以門賞耏班，使食其征，謂之耏門。","sentenceOrder":14},{"id":"s_work_ttr_107_15","chapterId":"ch_work_ttr_107","textTraditional":"晉之滅潞也，獲僑如之弟焚如。齊襄公之二年，鄋瞞伐齊，齊王子成父獲其弟榮如，埋其首於周首之北門。衛人獲其季簡如，鄋瞞由是遂亡。","sentenceOrder":15},{"id":"s_work_ttr_107_16","chapterId":"ch_work_ttr_107","textTraditional":"郕大子朱儒自安於夫鍾，國人弗徇。","sentenceOrder":16}],"overrides":{}}